# The relay's image (relay/Dockerfile) is built from the repository root. Only what it needs goes
# into the build context: everything else, local builds and data included, stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/protocol/
!relay/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.sqlite*
relay/deploy/
